name logbox
category Package
revision 24499
shortdesc e-TeX showbox facilities for exploration purposes
relocated 1
longdesc The command \logbox does \showbox without stopping the
longdesc compilation. The package's main command is \viewbox*: the box
longdesc is typeset (copied) with its dimensions, and its contents are
longdesc logged in the .log file.
